  "adaptation": "Retain both public arities, doc/metadata and multiply-then-checked-int steps. Replace Math.random with a private execution-time entropy intrinsic. Lexically capture the existing checked multiplication/int function values so core legacy coercing macros do not change the primary Object overloads. Standard random imports are selected explicitly from the resolved world and encoded with the generic WIT type encoder. Native sessions install OS entropy. No constant or compilation-time seed fallback.",
