  "qualification": "The original direct-literal transformations are retained as a distinct overload study. Public-API goldens use fresh explicitly boxed/Object multiplication and int casts matching retained rand/rand-int bytecode; one upper-fraction int result differs. They are controlled transformations, not JVM random-stream goldens. Provider feasibility is separate from production/public API acceptance; fresh native receipts are required.",
